 "words": 213,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "When the wicked close around me and they come to tear me down",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They are the ones who stumble and they crash onto the ground",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let an army camp against me, let the war break out tonight",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Even then I will be confident, the LORD is my light",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD is my light and my salvation",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whom shall I fear?",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD is the stronghold of my life",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Of whom shall I be afraid?",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One thing I ask of the LORD, this is what I seek",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To dwell in the house of the LORD all the days of my life",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To gaze on the beauty of the LORD",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And to seek him in his temple",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD is my light and my salvation",
